.TH "ptcli" "" "" ""
.SH "نام (NAME)"
ptcli \- A CLI to interact with phosh-thumbnailer.
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.sp
\fBptcli [OPTION…] /path/to/directory\fP
.sp
\fBptcli [OPTION…] /path/to/file_1 /path/to/file_2 …\fP
.sp
\fBptcli [OPTION…] \-\-stop\fP
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.sp
\fBptcli\fP can be used to interact with \fBphosh\-thumbnailer\fP(8) service. It is primarily used to
create thumbnails as per Thumbnail Managing Standard \%<https://\:specifications\:.freedesktop\:.org/\:thumbnail-spec/\:latest>\&.
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \fB\-h\fP, \fB\-\-help\fP
Print help options and exit.
.TP
.B \fB\-s\fP, \fB\-\-stop\fP
Stop the on\-going thumbnailing operation.
.TP
.B \fB\-v\fP, \fB\-\-version\fP
Print version and exit.
.UNINDENT
.SH "مثال‌ها (EXAMPLES)"
.sp
To create thumbnails for all files in the current directory:
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
ptcli .
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
To create thumbnails for all files in \fB$HOME/Pictures\fP:
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
ptcli $HOME/Pictures
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
To create thumbnails for a set of files:
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
ptcli $HOME/Pictures/foo.png bar.txt ../spam.ogg
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
To stop the on\-going thumbnailing operation:
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
ptcli \-\-stop
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.sp
\fBphosh\-thumbnailer\fP(8)
.\" End of generated man page.
